  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-03T14:32:27.583Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nWhen Group Banners are shown on nameplates their design changes a bit to accommodate them. The speech effect though gets not adjusted, there are a few issues with them because of this:\n\n1. When a User has a Profile Icon, there is a gap between it's speech outline and the one for the normal Nameplate.\n\n2. The speech effect is completely round, even though when a Group Banner is show the Nameplate only has rounded corners.\n\n3. Speech effect & outline overlaps with the Banner.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\n1. That gap shouldn't be there and the outline should continues until it merges with the Icon.\n\n2. The speech effect should have the same rounded corners as the Nameplate it self.\n\n3. The speech effect should probably go around the banner as well so it fits in with how the User Icon for example is handled. \n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a picture showcasing the issues:",
